   "src": "f571556e1123",
   "t": "It's no problem."
  },
  {
   "i": 1074,
   "src": "9074067cbe49",
   "t": "More importantly, is there anything else\nI can do next?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1079,
   "src": "b9a21fb07ca6",
   "t": "{{council_hyoga}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1085,
   "src": "800d375b0c72",
   "t": "No, it's fine, you must be tired from just\ngetting back."
  },
  {
   "i": 1088,
   "src": "5f19c8b1ae04",
   "t": "Rest until the President and the others\nreturn."
  },
  {
